My whole life I've never been respected. So if I went undercover on a Minecraft SMP that all of my friends play on, would I get my respect? It isn't so easy because I'm not allowing myself to die a single time. Will I be able to get my respect before my friends find out its me playing the server or will I die before I can even get a chance. This Server Doesn't Know I Exist. [A 100% unscripted video]

